    <text>IOC source ceilings are 5 V / 0.1 A. Protection defaults are 5.1 V / 0.11 A. Reconnect re-reads hardware state; commands are not queued while disconnected. Normal deployment remains read-only until hardware-write commissioning is explicitly enabled.</text>
